Convert this Slack thread into a runbook for resolving stuck specialist invocations:

@alice: hey did you see eng-ai is stuck for 5 min on the schema review case?
@bob: yeah retry once doesn't always work, sometimes the schema validator doesn't surface the right error
@alice: what we did last time was check output/<run-id>/events.jsonl and look for the trust-boundary log
@bob: right and if there's nothing there, kill the session and re-dispatch with the schema error in the prompt

Audience: on-call developer. Length: short, scannable, action-first.
